<title>SWEDEN: SAS to cancel cargo fuel surcharge April 15.</title>
<headline>SAS to cancel cargo fuel surcharge April 15.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scandinavian airline SAS said on Monday it would cancel its cargo fuel surcharge from April 15.</p>
<p>&quot;We are removing the extra cargo fuel surcharge from tomorrow,&quot; SAS spokesman Roger Engstrand told Reuters.</p>
